He checked the stitching twice before putting the tunic back on."],[2,"Dietrich Jackson pressed his ear to the tunnel wall under the Chalk Pits and heard it: tapping. Someone is digging toward him."],[5,"Ivo \"Ghost\" Lettersabcd cut Dietrich Jackson's hair with a bayonet and a cracked mirror. It is not good. It is, however, short."],[5,"The tapping under the Chalk Pits is closer. Dietrich Jackson and two others work in silence, in socks, by the light of one candle."],[6,"On a quiet night Pavel Menezes (Hegemony) and Dietrich Jackson (Concord) called out their names across no man's land, just to hear another voice. Now each knows exactly who is out there."],[9,"The guns found R-F10. Dietrich Jackson was dug out of a collapsed dugout with both legs pinned and carried back on a groundsheet."],[9,"Outside the aid post, Dietrich Jackson lies on a stretcher among the others. The orderlies step over him and say soon."],[10,"The wound Dietrich Jackson shrugged off has gone the wrong colour. He is not shrugging any more."],[11,"Dietrich Jackson died on a stretcher outside the aid post, still waiting for a bed. The medics had nothing left to give him."],[11,"Severin Jackson put a bullet that missed him beside the bunk. Someone who had known Dietrich Jackson helped clear the shelf without saying why."],[12,"A shell burst over R-F10 and Severin Jackson went down with a leg that would not hold him. The stretcher bearers came at a run."],[12,"Severin Jackson spent the night on a stretcher in the trench behind the aid post. Every bed was taken."],[16,"There were too few medics and too many wounded. Severin Jackson waited too long, and the wound grew worse for it."],[17,"The beds were full. Severin Jackson waits on a stretcher in the dark with a medic's promise and a dry mouth."],[18,"Every bed was taken and every medic was busy. Severin Jackson died waiting. The men at R-F10 have not stopped talking about it."],[18,"Karel \"Owl\" Jackson asked about Severin Jackson on arriving at R-F10. The first story concerned a stolen breakfast. He asked for another."],[23,"Karel \"Owl\" Jackson tried writing with gloves on. The address is readable. Everything else will require imagination."],[27,"Jonas Pavla and Karel \"Owl\" Jackson carried a kettle through three narrow traverses without spilling a drop. Applause at the destination caused the accident."],[28,"Karel \"Owl\" Jackson and Jonas Pavla argued all night about whose home town has the better beer. The argument has been adjourned until after the war."],[29,"A parcel contained a bar of chocolate broken into uneven pieces. Karel \"Owl\" Jackson closed his eyes while someone else distributed them."]]},"boards":{"longest":[{"handle":"_milan_kvasnicka_","name":"Viktor Kvasnicka","faction":0,"gen":1,"value":31},{"handle":"hanka_b97","name":"Bastian \"Owl\" Hanka","faction":0,"gen":1,"value":31},{"handle":"hodnepijumaloctu","name":"Valentin \"Crow\" Hodnepijumal","faction":0,"gen":1,"value":31},{"handle":"k4a.gr","name":"Felix Kagr","faction":1,"gen":1,"value":31},{"handle":"zaboravljeninemanjic","name":"Cyril \"Doc\" Zaboravljeni","faction":0,"gen":1,"value":31},{"handle":"_sebs.c_","name":"Konrad Sebs","faction":0,"gen":1,"value":30},{"handle":"_william.pearson_","name":"Oskar Pearson","faction":1,"gen":1,"value":30},{"handle":"0__freddie__0","name":"Wendel \"Mole\" Freddie","faction":0,"gen":1,"value":30},{"handle":"ahmadhcj07","name":"Bram Ahmadhcj","faction":0,"gen":1,"value":30},{"handle":"ana_serrano_7","name":"Isidor Serrano","faction":0,"gen":1,"value":30}],"houses":[{"handle":"_milan_kvasnicka_","name":"Viktor Kvasnicka","faction":0,"gen":1,"value":31},{"handle":"hanka_b97","name":"Bastian \"Owl\" Hanka","faction":0,"gen":1,"value":31},{"handle":"hodnepijumaloctu","name":"Valentin \"Crow\" Hodnepijumal","faction":0,"gen":1,"value":31},{"handle":"k4a.gr","name":"Felix Kagr","faction":1,"gen":1,"value":31},{"handle":"zaboravljeninemanjic","name":"Cyril \"Doc\" Zaboravljeni","faction":0,"gen":1,